{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is a game of finding anomalies in a setting similar to Exit 8, with the scene set in a Chinese middle school. It offers an experience of the campus scenery and abnormal events in China. There are over 200 anomalies, and the scale is dozens of times larger than that of Exit 8.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578710/extras/7.jpg?t=1747364558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real Physical Campus: </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is also the first game I made full-time after leaving my job. The campus scene is very large, featuring three five-story teaching buildings with a total of 15 floors, each floor having different classrooms. There are two six-story student dormitory buildings with a total of 12 floors, one cafeteria, one library, one comprehensive building, one administrative building, and one exhibition hall. Every floor is a newly created space with various abnormal events.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578710/extras/2.jpg?t=1747364558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578710/extras/1.jpg?t=1747364558\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578710/extras/3.jpg?t=1747364558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">There are several different enemy AIs. Players can't counter them but have to find the anomalies under their continuous attacks. As the principal, find all the anomalies in the school before the college entrance examination.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578710/extras/6.jpg?t=1747364558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">There are still 7 headmasters of different styles for you to choose from.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578710?t=1747364558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578710?t=1747364558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578710/e6cb6bd6a60ab3cfe65ea1be56f116ab693b6868/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747364558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578710/e6cb6bd6a60ab3cfe65ea1be56f116ab693b6868/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747364558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is a game of finding anomalies in a setting similar to Exit 8, with the scene set in a Chinese middle school. It offers an experience of the campus scenery and abnormal events in China. There are over 200 anomalies, and the scale is dozens of times larger than that of Exit 8.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578710/extras/7.jpg?t=1747364558\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real Physical Campus: </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is also the first game I made full-time after leaving my job. The campus scene is very large, featuring three five-story teaching buildings with a total of 15 floors, each floor having different classrooms. There are two six-story student dormitory buildings with a total of 12 floors, one cafeteria, one library, one comprehensive building, one administrative building, and one exhibition hall. Every floor is a newly created space with various abnormal events.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste